  "solution": "Option 1) ÷ and × \n\nInterchanging the mathematical sign we get;\n\n⇒ 55 × 5 + __**15 ÷ 45**__ - 30 = 180\n\n⇒ __**55 × 5**__ + 0.333 - 30 = 180\n\n⇒ __**275 + 0.333**__ - 30 = 180\n\n⇒ __**275.333 - 30**__ = 180\n\n⇒ 245.333 ≠ 180\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) × and +",
